50000300 TEXT 536 300 582 314 9AA4B2FF "CREDITS"
50000310 TEXT 536 322 1047 343 F5F7FAFF "Began as a fork of sal063's PSP Recompilation Project (GPL-2.0-or-later)."
50000311 TEXT 536 351 1012 372 F5F7FAFF "Carries PPSSPP lineage, FFmpeg's ATRAC3 decoders and the Clay layout"
50000311 TEXT 536 372 592 393 F5F7FAFF "library."
50000312 TEXT 536 401 1040 422 F5F7FAFF "Drawn with SDL and SDL_ttf, and set in Chakra Petch, Geist and Noto Sans"
50000312 TEXT 536 422 557 443 F5F7FAFF "JP."
500003F0 TEXT 536 451 806 467 6B7684FF "The full list is in CREDITS.md and NOTICE.md."
